{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n5-110":{"renderings":[{"id":"49c33bb623479166","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Used to ask about two choices or options."},{"id":"589d421cf16e0db8","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The どちら grammar point is used to ask about two choices or options. It translates to 'which of the two' or simply 'which' in English. It is commonly used with question words like どちらが or どちらを and can be combined with verbs, adjectives, and nouns to ask about preferences or to make comparisons."},{"id":"1ba93384711c0992","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"どちら + が/を + verb, どちら + が/を + adjective, どちら + が/を + noun"},{"id":"7910fa8fc93ac1c6","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"'Which (of two)', and the polite 'where / which way'. For three or more, どれ or どの."},{"id":"15abdcbb2d0f64a8","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"comparison"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Comparison (More Than / Which / The Most)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"comparison"}}]},"n5-110#a440ea6ebed2":{"renderings":[{"id":"c9d08026fad14415","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Which of these two apples is delicious?"}]},"n5-110#2dc26fbef3b0":{"renderings":[{"id":"e161f6501b42c70f","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Which dress would you like to wear?"}]},"n5-110#afb1e4c78d28":{"renderings":[{"id":"f5ac0ffc99e40c0a","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Which of these two towns do you want to go to?"}]},"n5-110#24b65d355974":{"renderings":[{"id":"0265af55f69e308c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n5-110"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Which movie do you think is interesting?"}]}}}